%% MUPP-042 Secret Santa: your person and change mails
%% What a member sees once the draw is made, and how a changed list reaches the giver by mail, once an hour.
flowchart TD
    S[Group started, draw in ss_draw] --> P[Own page: Min önskelista and Min matchning: NAME, R1]
    P -->|only the signed-in member's own receiver, R2| M[Match page: the receiver's wishes, read-only]
    N[Not started: grey card Inte tilldelad än, R1] -.-> P

    W[Receiver adds, edits or removes a wish] -->|group started?| Q{started}
    Q -->|no| X[No mark, no mail, R3]
    Q -->|yes| K[Mark the list as changed]
    K --> J[Job every 10 minutes: GitHub Actions calls POST /api/santa-mails with the secret]
    J --> C{marked, and no mail in the last hour?}
    C -->|no| Z[Nothing sent, R3]
    C -->|yes| T[Take the mark, send mail 5 to the giver: names the group, nobody else]
    T -->|mail fails| R[Mark put back, tried again next run]
    T -->|sent| D[List counts as told until the next change]
